1. Find a number is Odd or Even using Ternary and Arithmetic Operators

package com.J;


public class trail {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        int a = 2;

        String find = (a % 2 == 0) ? "Even" : "Odd";

        System.out.println("It is an " + find + " number");
        
        
    }
}

Output :
It is an Even number


