2. Write program using Logical Operators

package com.J;

import java.util.Scanner;

public class Sample {

	public static void main(String[] args) {
		
	  Scanner rock = new Scanner(System.in);
	  
	  System.out.println("is vishnu passed the exam ?");
	  
	  System.out.println("Enter the true or false:");
	  
	  boolean result = rock.nextBoolean();
	  
	  
	  System.out.println("Result: " + !result);
	  
	  rock.close();
		

	}

}

Output : 

is vishnu passed the exam ?
Enter the true or false:
false
Result: true
